Honeysuckle State Park
- Fix Spaceship
	if {Inventory.has_item("Catalytic_Converter")}:
		Would you like to spend a catalytic converter to go towards fixing your spaceship?
		- Yes
			if {Inventory.has_item("Catalytic_Converter")}:
				You use a catalytic converter to go towards fixing your spaceship.
				do Inventory.remove_item("Catalytic_Converter")
				set {catalytics_used} += 1
				if {catalytics_used} >= 2:
					do Dialogic.start("win")
				do Global.use_action()
		- No
	else:
		You don't have a catalytic converter
- Sleep (Requires Tent)
	if {Inventory.has_item("Tent")}:
		Would you like to sleep here?
		- Yes
			if {Inventory.has_item("Tent")}:
				You sleep in the park in your tent.
				do Global.change_resolve(-10)
				do Global.change_hunger(-10)
				do Global.sleep()
		- No
	else:
		You don't have a tent
- Dig for Treasure (Requires Shovel and Map)
	if {Inventory.has_item("Shovel")} and {Inventory.has_item("Map")}:
		Would you like to dig for treasure?
		- Yes
			if {Inventory.has_item("Shovel")} and {Inventory.has_item("Map")}:
				set {random_chance} = range(1,100).pick_random()
				if {random_chance} <= 30:
					You found nothing
					do Global.use_action()
				elif {random_chance} >= 31 and {random_chance} <= 60:
					set {temp_money} = range(5,26).pick_random()
					set {Global.player_money} += {temp_money}
					You found {temp_money} money
					Your total money is now {Global.player_money}
					do Global.use_action()
				elif {random_chance} >= 61 and {random_chance} <= 90:
					do Inventory.add_item("Food")
					You found food
					do Global.use_action()
				elif {random_chance} >= 91:
					do Inventory.add_item("Catalytic_Converter")
					You found a Catalytic Converter
					do Global.use_action()
		- No
	else:
		You don't have the required items